Protocol provenance
===================
Each parameter is traced to (a) the paper it comes from, page-checked against the author-posted PDFs
(references/fetch_papers.sh), and (b) the code implicit.harvard.edu runs, pinned as submodules:
  upstream/minno-tasks  IAT/iat10.js                                 the IAT task
                        docs/studies/datapipe.iat.examples/demo.iats/  the demo site's task configs (race.js ...)
                        docs/studies/raceiat/raceiat_instructions.jst  the pre-IAT instructions page
  upstream/minno-time   src/js/extensions/dscore/parcelMng.js          the D scorer (pipScorer) iat10.js uses
IAT/qualtrics/quiat9.js is the Qualtrics variant of iat10.js; every parameter below is the same in both
except the block-5 wording.  Citations: references/papers.bib.

